WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.044
Operation Hourglass
is the culmination

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:07.215
of nearly two decades of
Project Monarch's work.

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:11.177
Human discovery and
reconnaissance of the territory

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.847
between us and them.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.015
Watch your heads, gentlemen.

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.104
A place that will
redefine our understanding

00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:24.232
of the entire planet
and ensure the health

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:27.277
and welfare of all humanity.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:34.367
And if we don't get there first,
senator, comrade Khrushchev

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.702
will.

00:00:45.086 --> 00:00:47.005
What you're about to
see is more than just

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:49.591
a victory for American
scientific know-how

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:50.759
or our defense.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.970
This mission is a matter
of global security

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.848
and the preservation
of mankind, gentlemen.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.183
Please take a seat.

